'''Primeval Currents''' (じゃぶじゃぶ旧海道 ''Jabujabu Kyū Kaidō'', '''Stirring Old Sea Circuit''') is the 4th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 53rd sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 7.1 Update|version 7.1]], and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
A decently challenging sub-chapter. [[Marine Town]] and [[Wandering Conch]] are arguably the easiest in the sub-chapter, while [[Palcaccio Waters]] and [[Rutsborg Vortex]] are by far the hardest.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Othom]]: [[Mooth]]'s [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant, with high health, damage and speed, plus a 100% chance to Curse cats for 2 seconds. Notably, he attacks from a range of 340 but hits cats up to 440 range away, allowing it to outrange many more units.

